      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Nitric oxide synthase of the bronchial epithelium and concentrations of nitric oxide metabolites (NO(2)(-)and NO(3)(-)) in bronchoalveolar lavage fluids were measured in rats with bronchial asthma after fenoterol inhalation. It was suggested that nitric oxide-ergic mechanisms can mediate the effects of inhaled beta(2)-adrenergic agonists."},
